OL,3,A'It gave us goosebumps': First visitors
OL,4,Asee Bayeux Tapestry as London
OL,5,Aexhibition opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FNothing prepared me for how I felt when
OL,8,FI looked down on it for the first time,
OL,9,Four culture editor writes
OL,11,FWant the best viewing experience? Get
OL,12,Fup close and keep an eye on the birds.
OL,13,FIf you missed tickets this time,
OL,14,Fthere's still hope
OL,16,FThe tapestry tells the story of the
OL,17,FNorman Conquest of England and the
OL,18,FBattle of Hastings in 1066 - learn the
OL,19,FBayeux basics
